id: DRAFT-xjobs-command-discovery-text
trigger_tool: sh|make|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: alias not found
severity: 2
category: portability|shell|testing
match_keywords: alias not found
title: 命令发现描述被当命令执行并掩盖依赖失败
root_cause: helper捕获command -v的alias描述后在命令位置展开，实际调用alias并忽略失败，后续expr仍决定退出码
affected_scope: 以lookup stdout作为命令执行的Shell helper，且受测shell报告alias；仅存在性探测或要求外部路径的消费者不直接适用
verification_cmd: 复核H1-011旧失败、H1-020实际lookup、H1-021延时与错误分支、H1-025真实上游及v2本地软件W3原件；本轮新增软件运行0
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: command-name-selection-with-dependency-error
rec_description: lookup仅判断退出状态，按选中名称实际调用，引用参数并在依赖失败时退出当前helper；保留expr业务判断
rec_command: if command -v gsleep >/dev/null 2>&1; then gsleep "$1" || exit 2; else sleep "$1" || exit 2; fi
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: source-patch
